The repository contains only:

```text
README.md
```

The README contains only the repository title.

There are no checked-in:

- Cognos dashboard exports;
- Looker models;
- LookML files;
- screenshots;
- datasets;
- queries;
- configuration;
- implementation notes.

The title reliably records an intended learning topic involving:

- IBM Cognos Analytics;
- Google Looker;
- business-intelligence dashboards.

It does not provide evidence that either platform was actually used to build a dashboard in this repository snapshot.
